uu-remote-for-linux (@VERSION@) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Adapt UU 4.43 NVENC, NVDEC, portrait capture and WOL compatibility.
  * Fix scaled Wayland/X11 capture, cursor mapping and viewer layouts.
  * Read native GNOME Wayland Caps/Num Lock state.
  * Keep the universal DEB free of Mutter payloads and repair management.
  * Document the compositor defect separately from UU lock-state handling.
  * Accept legacy and RFC2253 installer subjects with strict publisher checks.
  * Restore the real tray home and recover missing backend initialization.
  * Keep the display-sync companion opt-in and host display settings excluded.

 -- Wenqi Guo <129141646+GuoWQ222@users.noreply.github.com>  @DEBIAN_DATE@
